      {
        "id": 228418,
        "name": "riff.freelance",
        "username": "riff.freelance",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/riff.freelance/{size}/2050_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-09-25T00:56:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Going back to Voss for a minute; a damage race can be fun and winable with pretty \"normal\" heroes. Legacy, Visionary, Absolute Zero, and Tempest in their vanilla modes can get out all enemies take 2+ damage at the start of almost every hero's turn. Add Wraith with Stun for damage control and Smoke bombs with an armored hero and you can just beat Voss down. Or&nbsp;Ra and careful use of Twist the Ether can make heroes all but immune to a target.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:02:54.225Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
