        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-09-25T12:41:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Not sure if this has been mentioend yet, but Expatriette with a couple of damage buffs can insta-kill any Minions via Hairtrigger Reflexes the moment they come out - she'd need a little more buffing if a Guard comes out but Legacy and Ra can easily provide. Fight in Insula Primalis for all the damage buffs you'll ever need and laugh when Voss plays Forced Deployment :D.</p>",
        "post_number": 26,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:02:54.306Z",
